; `offset` on the tempo statement: the song-level pattern-clock shift, in
; beats. Fractional and negative values are both legal; the trailing
; settings are a repeated name/number pair, so order does not matter and
; either one may be omitted.
tempo 125 beats 16 offset 1
voice 0 "c4 e4 g4 c5"
voice 1 "c2!4"
